<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσκαιρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>occasional,
			extraordinary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1368.44
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ π. ἐπιβολαί</span> the
				<i>additional</i> taxes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.979.19
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δημόσια τέλη κανονικά τε καὶ π.
					τούτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					168.36
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>opportune</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδρομαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pel.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θόρυβοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆμα</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				274
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>at the time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. ἄδηλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.78
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσκαιρον, τό</span>, <i>agreement having temporary validity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				6000v
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				35
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lasting for a time, temporary</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.3.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					46.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἡ τέρψις</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθάνατος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰώνιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				4.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.14
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); <i>transient,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				13.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.8.8
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.31
				</span></i>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				4.14.7
			</span></i>.</div>
